v1.0 (13-Okt-96)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 - Rewritten for v1.0 of the FAME includes and DoorStartup code.

 - Complete error handling implemented via DOS returncodes and IoErr()
   DOS error code implementation. Additional user informations about
   IoErr() via PrintFault().

 - ReadArgs will now be used for argument parsing.

 - User signals will be supported via an example of the timer.device.
